Package: rdz
Title: Versioned Serialization for R Objects
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Pedro", "Baltazar", email = "pedrobtz@gmail.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"))
Description: Writes and reads R objects using a versioned container format
    implemented in Rust. The format preserves R serialization semantics while
    adding explicit format identification, length validation, and integrity
    checking.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Copyright: The authors and copyright holders of the bundled Rust crates are
    listed in file inst/COPYRIGHTS.
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 8.0.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.5.0)
Suggests:
    bench,
    devtools,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
SystemRequirements: Cargo (>= 1.88.0) (Rust's package manager), rustc (>= 1.88.0)
